---
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro';
import BobTheSeagull from '../components/BobTheSeagull.astro';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Support Fin & Games</title><style>
:root{--bg:#081018;--surface:#101c26;--border:rgba(255,255,255,.09);--accent:#fbbf24;--text:#f8fafc;--muted:#a8b6c4}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:16px/1.7 system-ui,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:1.5rem}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:1.5rem}nav{display:flex;gap:1.2rem}nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}.hero{padding:6rem 0 3rem}.eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font:500 .78rem monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,7vw,5rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:.8rem 0 1rem}.lead{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--muted)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem}.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:1.7rem}.card p{color:var(--muted)}.button{display:inline-block;padding:.75rem 1rem;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:#241b05;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}footer{margin-top:4rem;padding:2rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}@media(max-width:650px){header{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:1rem}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head><body><div class="wrap"><header><a href="/"><Logo size={42}/></a><nav><a href="/games">Games</a><a href="/games/caravan-park-tycoon/development">Development</a><a href="/npc-builder">NPC Builder</a><a href="/about">About</a></nav></header><main><section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">Help build the park</div><h1>Support Fin & Games.</h1><p class="lead">Caravan Park Tycoon is an indie project being built in the open. If you want to help it grow, you can support the studio and, eventually, become part of the game.</p></section><section class="grid"><article class="card"><h2>☕ Ko-fi</h2><p>Want to tip the developer or support a particular piece of work? Ko-fi will be one of the ways to support the project.</p><a class="button" href="https://ko-fi.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Ko-fi — coming soon</a></article><article class="card"><h2>⭐ Patreon</h2><p>Patreon will be aimed at people who want to follow development more closely and receive supporter perks.</p><a class="button" href="https://www.patreon.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Patreon — coming soon</a></article></section><section class="card" style="margin-top:1rem"><div class="eyebrow">Planned supporter perk</div><h2>Put yourself in the game.</h2><p>The NPC Builder is currently a prototype. The planned idea is simple: support Fin & Games, create your own NPC, submit it for moderation, and eventually see your character appear in Caravan Park Tycoon.</p><p>We're deliberately not locking down the exact tiers or payment-gated content yet. The game is still in prototype, and the perk system should evolve with it.</p><a class="button" href="/npc-builder">See the NPC Builder prototype</a></section></main><footer><a href="/" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">← Back to Fin & Games</a></footer></div><BobTheSeagull/></body></html>